OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh's Princes Street to
OL,4,Afully reopen by end of year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe remaining part of one of
OL,7,FEdinburgh's busiest streets is set to
OL,8,Fbe reopened by the end of December,
OL,9,Faccording to a council report.
OL,11,FPrinces Street was partially closed for
OL,12,Fseven weeks after a fire ripped through
OL,13,Fa B-listed building in the early hours
OL,14,Fof 9 July, causing widespread
OL,15,Fdisruption to buses, trams and
OL,16,Fbusinesses.
OL,18,FThe road reopened to pedestrians,
OL,19,Fvehicles and trams in late August, but
OL,20,Fpart of the pavement remained closed
OL,21,Fwhile contractors continued work to
OL,22,Fsecure the building.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
