OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh's Princes Street to
OL,4,Afully reopen by end of year
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a report to the City of Edinburgh
OL,7,FCouncil's transport and environment
OL,8,Fcommittee, which meets on Thursday,
OL,9,Fofficials said most of the pavement
OL,10,Fshould return to normal use by the end
OL,11,Fof the year.
